# Canonical fully constrained benchmark plate. Keep mutable examples out of
# deterministic test inputs so a user's design experiment cannot alter the gate.
PROJECT constrained_sketch
UNITS mm

PARAMETER plate_width 40 mm
PARAMETER plate_height 25 mm
ANGLE corner_angle 90 deg

SKETCH mounting_outline
POINT origin 0 mm 0 mm FIXED
POINT lower_right 38 mm 2 mm
POINT upper_right 39 mm 28 mm
POINT upper_left -1 mm 24 mm
CONSTRAINT bottom_horizontal HORIZONTAL origin lower_right
CONSTRAINT right_vertical VERTICAL lower_right upper_right
CONSTRAINT top_horizontal HORIZONTAL upper_right upper_left
CONSTRAINT left_vertical VERTICAL upper_left origin
CONSTRAINT width_bottom DISTANCE origin lower_right plate_width
CONSTRAINT height_right DISTANCE lower_right upper_right plate_height
CONSTRAINT width_top DISTANCE upper_right upper_left plate_width
CONSTRAINT height_left DISTANCE upper_left origin plate_height
CONSTRAINT square_corner ANGLE origin lower_right upper_right corner_angle
END

MATERIAL plate_material ALUMINUM
BODY plate
MATERIAL plate_material
FEATURE stock
TYPE EXTRUDE
PROFILE mounting_outline
HEIGHT 4 mm
END
END
